    "answer": "No",
    "evidence": "Description indicates RNA extracted from patients undergoing coronary angiography (110 patients with CAD and 112 controls); no mention of cell lines or experimental disease models.",
    "justification": "Data derive from patient blood samples rather than patient-derived in vitro cell lines or model systems."
  },
  "q5_case_control_design": {
    "answer": "Yes",
    "evidence": "Methods: 'RNA was extracted from 110 patients with CAD (CADi>23) and from 112 partially matched controls without CAD (CADi=0)'; Experimental design: parallel group design; Experimental Factors include PATIENT GROUP.",
    "justification": "Study compares cases (CAD) to controls (no CAD), fulfilling a case/control design."
